{\plain \fs24 }{\plain \fs24 \b The Only Kind of Comparison Worth Doing: \par
}\pard \fs24\qc 
{\plain \fs24 \b History, Epistemology and the  {\u8220\'93}Strong Program{\u8221\'94} of Comparative Study}{\plain \fs24 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \par
